RPN calculator.  Numbers and + - * / %, dup swap drop clear, q to quit.
> 3 4 +
= 7
> 2 *
= 14
> dup *
= 196
> 10 3 /
= 3
> -7 2 /
= -3
> -7 2 %
= -1
> 1 0 /
error: divide by zero
> drop drop drop drop drop
= 196
> swap
error: stack empty
> 2147483647 1 +
= -2147483648
> -2147483648 -1 /
error: overflow
> 99999999999
error: too big
> foo
error: unknown 'foo'
> 5 6 swap -
= 1
> clear
(empty)
> 12x  3 4 +
= 17
> q
bye
